  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.<br>• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks.<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes (see ingredients).<br>• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).<br>• In a small bowl, combine garlic aioli and harissa paste. Set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709720a5a49c635d8a868f/step-67fbfb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine onion, the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.<br>• Microwave onion in 30 second bursts, until softened.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709720a5a49c635d8a868f/step-75d24910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.<br>• Remove from heat, then add the honey, turning to coat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709720a5a49c635d8a868f/step-e81ae120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, snacking tomatoes, cucumber, pickled onion and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.<br>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.<br>• Top tortillas with cherry tomato and pickled onion salad and honey haloumi.<br>• Drizzle over harissa aioli and sprinkle over everything garnish to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709720a5a49c635d8a868f/step-709f7a30.jpg"
    }
  ]
